content:
好的，下面是一个完整的单文件扫雷游戏。直接保存为 `.html` 打开即可运行：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>扫雷</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #1a1a2e;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: #eee;
    user-select: none;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .toolbar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    background: #16213e;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 70px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .stat span { color: #f9d423; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  button {
    background: #e94560;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: .95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform .1s, background .15s;
  }
  button:hover { background: #ff6b6b; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .board-wrap {
    position: relative;
    background: #0f3460;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  }
  .board {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .cell {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .1s, transform .05s;
    border: 1px solid #1a3a5c;
  }
  .cell.hidden { background: #2a5a8c; }
  .cell.hidden:hover { background: #3a6fa8; }
  .cell.revealed { background: #e8e8e8; color: #222; cursor: default; }
  .cell.mine { background: #e94560; color: #fff; }
  .cell.flagged { background: #2a5a8c; }
  .cell.flagged:hover { background: #3a6fa8; }
  .cell.safe { background: #2a5a8c; }
  .num { color: #2a6db8; }
  .num[data-n="1"] { color: #2a6db8; }
  .num[data-n="2"] { color: #2e7d32; }
  .num[data-n="3"] { color: #c62828; }
  .num[data-n="4"] { color: #4a148c; }
  .num[data-n="5"] { color: #7b1fa2; }
  .num[data-n="6"] { color: #004d40; }
  .num[data-n="7"] { color: #451a93; }
  .num[data-n="8"] { color: #1a1a1a; }
  .num[data-n="9"] { color: #b71c1c; }
  .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.65);
    border-radius: 12px;
    z-index: 10;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .25s;
  }
  .overlay.show { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
  .overlay .msg {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .overlay .msg.win { color: #4caf50; }
  .overlay .msg.lose { color: #e94560; }
  .hint {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: .8rem;
    color: #888;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>⚡ 扫雷</h1>

<div class="toolbar">
  <div class="stat">🚩 <span id="flags">0</span></div>
  <div class="stat">💣 <span id="mines">0</span></div>
  <div class="stat">⏱️ <span id="timer">0</span>s</div>
  <button id="restartBtn">重开</button>
</div>

<div class="board-wrap">
  <div class="board" id="board"></div>
  <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
    <div class="msg" id="overlayMsg"></div>
  </div>
</div>
